<urn:uxf:requirement:locale-directional-layout:positive:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Rendered output uses the consumer-selected locale and direction, keeps control meaning and reading order coherent under directional layout, and makes the active locale discoverable without assuming the consumer's locale set or fallback policy." <urn:uxf:graph:accessibility-i18n-risk> .
<urn:uxf:requirement:locale-directional-layout:positive:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:uxf:graph:accessibility-i18n-risk> .
