<urn:uxf:requirement:locale-directional-layout:negative:1> <urn:usf:predicate:text> "Rendered output never represents unsupported or fallback content as a selected locale, never reverses semantic order merely to mirror layout, and never relies on untranslated text or direction-specific placement as the only meaning cue." <urn:uxf:graph:accessibility-i18n-risk> .
<urn:uxf:requirement:locale-directional-layout:negative:1> <urn:usf:predicate:type> <urn:usf:type:Requirement> <urn:uxf:graph:accessibility-i18n-risk> .
